      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article focuses on the unique concerns of pediatric surgical patients and emphasizes preparation of the family as an integrated unit. The statement from older standards of the American Nurses' Association that \"children have the right to be treated with dignity and respect\" remains a valid challenge for nurses caring for these patients."},
